Hair Salon Booking & Home Service Platform — Project Description
1. Project Overview

The Hair Salon Booking & Home Service Platform is a modern, responsive web application designed to allow customers to conveniently browse available hairstyles, select their preferred hairstyle, choose where they want the service performed, and book an appointment online.

Customers can choose between:

In-Salon Service — The customer visits the salon.
Home Service — A professional stylist travels to the customer's location.

The platform is designed around a simple principle:

Choose your style. Choose your location. Choose your time. We take care of the rest.

Customers do not pay when making the booking. Payment is made after the hairstyle/service has been completed, with transportation included in the service arrangement.

The initial product should focus on a high-end landing page and booking experience, rather than a complex customer dashboard.

