18. Important Booking Rules

The system should enforce several rules.

Appointment availability

A customer should only be able to select available appointment slots.

Stylist availability

If specific stylists are assigned to particular hairstyles, the system should check their availability.

Home service

Home bookings must collect the customer's service location.

Transportation

Transportation should automatically be included in the booking calculation according to the salon's pricing rules.

For example:

Hairstyle                 GHS 250
Home Service Transport    GHS 30
--------------------------------
Total                     GHS 280

Payment Due: After Service

Or, if transportation is included in the hairstyle price:

Hairstyle                 GHS 280
Transportation            Included
--------------------------------
Payment Due: After Service

