Overall Product Concept

The website should ultimately feel like a combination of a premium salon website + online appointment marketplace + mobile/home hairstyling service.

The key customer journey should be:

See a hairstyle → Want it → Book it → Choose home or salon → Pick a time → Get styled → Pay after completion.